  "referenceNumber": "SUD0062",
  "remarks": "\nThe Secretary of State has reasonable grounds to suspect that  Ibrahim Gibril OMER (“Abu Wafi”) is an involved person under the Sudan (Sanctions) (EU Exit) Regulations 2020\n \nbecause  he is or has been involved in a relevant activity, namely being responsible for and providing support for the commission of  violations of international humanitarian law in Sudan, through his role as Major of the Rapid Support Forces and Commander for the North Darfur section of the Rapid Support Forces, and through his association with Gedo Hamdan Ahmed, an involved person.\n",
